7871D8DE80CDB253A34864C48E511276D20\n- Signed with the UltraGram release key (CN=UltraGram Android).\n\n## Windows installer\n- Size: 94729416 bytes (90.3 MB)\n- SHA-256: 9A403ACBD0DBD17F759E8BBD89AA57B8F7F71D0B9FE0D470EABA82BBCD8EFB6B\n\n## Administrators\nTwo ADMIN accounts exist in the backend database: ultragram_admin and Fyn8zrox2, both active with verification status Admin and roles ADMIN + Verified UltraGram. Passwords are not published.\n\n## Notes\n- Production HTTPS domain must be provided by the operator; the app lets the user enter it in Settings.\n- The release APK default server URL is empty by design (no invented domain)."}